{"versions":[{"path":"versions/1a0ef1ac-489b-4b4b-8db6-ba3fe9e30331/6a8fdff894f2af793547d6297b1834896fab6ca4e12b8bb4a2fde9b99de6bc39.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"1a0ef1ac-489b-4b4b-8db6-ba3fe9e30331","revision":"sha256:6a8fdff894f2af793547d6297b1834896fab6ca4e12b8bb4a2fde9b99de6bc39","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Making $N$ insertions into an initally empty binomial queue takes $O(N)$ time in the worst case."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"2f06c8e4-9d95-4b60-bdd6-bb92b09cd5df"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"2f34b42d-8616-4209-89b1-528483699ccd"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"连续插入 $N$ 次的链接次数为 $N-\\operatorname{popcount}(N)$, 总时间为 $\\Theta(N)$"}]}}},{"path":"versions/9cbedeea-f254-4abe-8cdb-17adc2ae5170/54b5ade6f5f2045840506748def08979c20f296e8d5526b75b5be15b8811dfec.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"9cbedeea-f254-4abe-8cdb-17adc2ae5170","revision":"sha256:54b5ade6f5f2045840506748def08979c20f296e8d5526b75b5be15b8811dfec","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"The result of inserting keys 1 to $2^k -1$ for any $k>4$ in order into an initially empty skew heap is always a full binary tree."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"699df602-2cdb-4285-ada1-f7d6f2ac0322"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"eebf5f7b-3a58-4115-a6c9-b371ef6bcd1b"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"递增插入时元素交替进入左右子树, $2^k-1$ 个节点形成满层的完全二叉树"}]}}},{"path":"versions/106b6e49-4b07-456f-b496-62c0cafc11ce/8578e1f1ab6f83eabf88efda21bda9888521fba88c147b0f6664068970e06818.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"106b6e49-4b07-456f-b496-62c0cafc11ce","revision":"sha256:8578e1f1ab6f83eabf88efda21bda9888521fba88c147b0f6664068970e06818","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"With the same operations, the resulting leftist heap is always more balanced than the skew heap."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"88ebc5f8-541c-4a4e-a73b-eef7186d5435"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"5feaf036-2d04-48a4-a81a-be04cbb23469"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"左式堆限制的是右路径长度, 整棵树的平衡程度与斜堆无固定大小关系"}]}}},{"path":"versions/f681273a-bbef-40fc-a2bf-038b5dde9283/4ed97077bee9ac60bce56b15af256fc0d1131961b2d28d5d39ec6759ac2adf4a.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"f681273a-bbef-40fc-a2bf-038b5dde9283","revision":"sha256:4ed97077bee9ac60bce56b15af256fc0d1131961b2d28d5d39ec6759ac2adf4a","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Inserting a number into a binomial heap with 15 nodes costs less time than inserting a number into a binomial heap with 19 nodes."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"ae938cac-384e-4752-b26f-2b4851f103f9"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"2a3b3d38-0a92-4c69-a759-49c5b6ba9474"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"15 的二进制末尾有 4 个 1, 插入需连续链接 4 次; 19 末尾有 2 个 1, 需链接 2 次"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7866d61a-04b3-4fcc-ab11-27e2efa9fc79/fdc539935742ea72c4a5f651ff91f9e47016682388736d25012e303e1f7e9b71.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"7866d61a-04b3-4fcc-ab11-27e2efa9fc79","revision":"sha256:fdc539935742ea72c4a5f651ff91f9e47016682388736d25012e303e1f7e9b71","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"For a binomial queue, delete-min takes a constant time on average."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"c5e00067-ff63-4484-a48e-56920e667c7c"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"6c490da4-38f2-4631-a08f-8bb7bf0793f4"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"删除最小值需要处理根表并合并子树, 插入的常数摊还时间不能直接用于删除操作"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7e8aa857-5991-4b5d-8f5c-17d4bd491b25/bb3c1bde66606662c097a6d14a668931344c83e05b6af04e893147090495a4c7.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"7e8aa857-5991-4b5d-8f5c-17d4bd491b25","revision":"sha256:bb3c1bde66606662c097a6d14a668931344c83e05b6af04e893147090495a4c7","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"To implement a binomial queue, the subtrees of a binomial tree are linked in increasing sizes."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"01f5ae51-46a0-4927-a234-70f64ed902a7"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"90233746-8c68-455b-91a7-6a78d0614b01"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"采用 LeftChild/NextSibling 表示时, 孩子子树按规模递减链接"}]}}},{"path":"versions/cc33682b-7922-4d24-baca-2865f632af1f/89deda0159019b2b52df6df5d991f7135714c899d995c0e232d0f0cdaf783917.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"cc33682b-7922-4d24-baca-2865f632af1f","revision":"sha256:89deda0159019b2b52df6df5d991f7135714c899d995c0e232d0f0cdaf783917","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"For a leftist heap with $N$ nodes, the worst-case running time of all operations (insert/delete min/merge) is $\\Theta(N)$."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"bd4f02c0-ffaa-4eb6-8062-b01e18ae8f7e"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"3f1de07c-a472-4151-ae30-aebee0363d64"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"左式堆右路径长度为 $O(\\log N)$, 常规插入、删除最小值和合并均有 $O(\\log N)$ 最坏时间上界"}]}}},{"path":"versions/d328889e-a1cf-42c4-b3c4-5d8d7ca1fde8/ff411c770675330f256d829414023b1a3db9194f22115fa0ced3c7e9bc3cc4b8.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"d328889e-a1cf-42c4-b3c4-5d8d7ca1fde8","revision":"sha256:ff411c770675330f256d829414023b1a3db9194f22115fa0ced3c7e9bc3cc4b8","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"For a binomial queue, merging takes a constant time on average."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"ecd906e3-7ecd-4bc8-b552-5dfedd5be36b"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"d335269a-070d-4304-b2fd-6b00bf4a8289"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"合并操作按二进制位处理树表, 最坏耗时 $O(\\log N)$; 常数摊还插入的结论不适用于任意合并"}]}}},{"path":"versions/93745ea6-ec16-4fa8-a929-003199de916f/97bbba3c65a6e42050583c6b7e62cde0e364a8bc1fbee05b876b727bbd18bdf0.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"93745ea6-ec16-4fa8-a929-003199de916f","revision":"sha256:97bbba3c65a6e42050583c6b7e62cde0e364a8bc1fbee05b876b727bbd18bdf0","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Merge the two leftist heaps in the following figure. Which one of the following statements is FALSE?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/1dd9ab2314145047fc98637e5dea4952b187cb65cf1410a1c0ebbbd08d58eb60.jpg","alt":"题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"the depths of 24 and 8 are the same","correct":false,"option_id":"282d7c09-bcd7-4c52-8ed8-71a5199d1cfe"},{"type":"text","content":"the null path length of 7 is the same as that of 12","correct":false,"option_id":"952461ee-68f6-4dcd-8731-cdd613d6c7b1"},{"type":"text","content":"6 is the root with 7 being its right child","correct":false,"option_id":"167184ec-75a1-47d6-b2f6-d275c2575e8a"},{"type":"text","content":"37 is the left child of 7","correct":true,"option_id":"86c602f8-2057-412c-90ad-9c61cab7482b"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"合并后 7 的左孩子为 8, 右孩子为 37"}]}}},{"path":"versions/4774f8c4-dbd9-4bd8-9320-b5d7b779a19b/53657fffeec97d1a99e0b9321a360e995bba0ee3e2b8738ef226502e1c2117d7.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"4774f8c4-dbd9-4bd8-9320-b5d7b779a19b","revision":"sha256:53657fffeec97d1a99e0b9321a360e995bba0ee3e2b8738ef226502e1c2117d7","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"We can perform BuildHeap for leftist heaps by considering each element as a one-node leftist heap, placing all these heaps on a queue, and performing the following step: Until only one heap is on the queue, dequeue two heaps, merge them, and enqueue the result. Which one of the following statements is FALSE?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"in the $k$-th run, $\\lceil N/2^k \\rceil$ leftist heaps are formed, each contains $2^k$ nodes","correct":false,"option_id":"94e5f494-46b8-4c88-82f5-76a3ba9f2b15"},{"type":"text","content":"the worst case is when $N=2^K$ for some integer $K$","correct":false,"option_id":"65daa43e-52c0-4c95-9066-b3ed78543bc8"},{"type":"text","content":"the time complexity $T(N) = O(\\frac{N}{2}log 2^0 + \\frac{N}{2^2}log 2^1 + \\frac{N}{2^3}log 2^2 + \\cdots + \\frac{N}{2^K}log 2^{K-1})$ for some integer $K$ so that $N=2^K$","correct":false,"option_id":"35761514-eb64-4d55-97e6-bd60b0214b3c"},{"type":"text","content":"the worst case time complexity of this algorithm is $\\Theta (NlogN)$","correct":false,"option_id":"c1d646cf-ea59-4898-bc12-03f79ca48f83"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"两两合并建堆的总时间为 $\\Theta(N)$, 因此 $\\Theta(N\\log N)$ 是预期错误项。题面还称每轮的树均有 $2^k$ 个节点, 当 $N$ 不是 2 的幂时可能不成立, 最坏情况的表述也有歧义"}],"answer_status":"unavailable","selection_mode":"single"}}},{"path":"versions/2fac93ad-9754-4dd1-b978-dc2cba20f0d2/60cacc5594259701f759f2f272ff8efcacde8957906e5834eb59fbbc09949dd7.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"2fac93ad-9754-4dd1-b978-dc2cba20f0d2","revision":"sha256:60cacc5594259701f759f2f272ff8efcacde8957906e5834eb59fbbc09949dd7","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"After deleting number 14 from a binomial queue of 5 numbers { 12, 13, 14, 23, 24 }, which of the followings is impossible?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"the LeftChild link of the node 12 is NULL;","correct":true,"option_id":"f7a11b62-fe61-4cfc-911f-761ba432a25c"},{"type":"text","content":"the NextSibling link of the node 12 is NULL;","correct":false,"option_id":"adfd576b-d9be-4199-967c-5feb7bff60dd"},{"type":"text","content":"the LeftChild link of node 24 is NULL;","correct":false,"option_id":"18fec854-390d-421f-8653-5f625cdb941f"},{"type":"text","content":"the NextSibling link of node 13 may point to node 23;","correct":false,"option_id":"e6b0d153-5c4b-463b-8918-f3e207cea9a3"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"删除后剩 4 个节点, 构成一棵 $B_2$; 最小键 12 为根且有孩子, LeftChild 非空"}]}}},{"path":"versions/dace425d-3b37-4ecd-b896-cd43762655f6/695a9942ecd881c3152a4aa48d77b817981dd11e7f57b5470a5fd7fd50810f01.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"dace425d-3b37-4ecd-b896-cd43762655f6","revision":"sha256:695a9942ecd881c3152a4aa48d77b817981dd11e7f57b5470a5fd7fd50810f01","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"The potential function $Q$ of a binomial queue is the number of the trees. After merging two binomial queues $H1$ with 22 nodes and $H2$ with 13 nodes，what is the potential change $Q (H1+H2)-(Q (H1)+Q (H2))$ ?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"0","correct":false,"option_id":"0a66eed6-b4be-403d-a36b-dbfb7bf29063"},{"type":"text","content":"2","correct":false,"option_id":"cb5118ea-b599-40d7-ae62-97b58345fca0"},{"type":"text","content":"-3","correct":true,"option_id":"db077dc4-68e9-4544-a3ae-e8b3a46613da"},{"type":"text","content":"-2","correct":false,"option_id":"e787afc8-8fb9-4c31-9b77-23103f8a3bde"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"$22=10110_2$, $13=1101_2$, $35=100011_2$ 的置位数都是 3, 势能变化为 $3-3-3=-3$"}]}}},{"path":"versions/326262eb-9bf8-4953-ae09-bebb6f374053/254545352bdb3781f63c3c11ecd253a7acf292a84da3d045a742e1a414d9f0f4.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"326262eb-9bf8-4953-ae09-bebb6f374053","revision":"sha256:254545352bdb3781f63c3c11ecd253a7acf292a84da3d045a742e1a414d9f0f4","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"After inserting number 20 into a binomial queue of 6 numbers { 12, 13, 14, 23, 24, 35 }, which of the followings is impossible?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"the NextSibling link of the node 20 is NULL","correct":false,"option_id":"99a1da65-bf7b-432e-a603-c5ceec808586"},{"type":"text","content":"the LeftChild link of node 12 may point to node 14","correct":false,"option_id":"01040101-9cac-4833-b2f1-b469f7c3ede4"},{"type":"text","content":"the LeftChild link of the node 20 is NULL","correct":false,"option_id":"487a8e60-0a52-4ae4-8fc2-1b5d6c28983d"},{"type":"text","content":"the NextSibling link of node 14 may point to node 20","correct":true,"option_id":"7a7860f4-da6c-47a4-b689-536632b34904"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"$6=2^2+2^1$, $B_0$ 槽位为空。插入 20 后, 它成为独立的 $B_0$ 根, NextSibling 为空"}]}}},{"path":"versions/93ec24eb-1be7-4c9e-9f05-9a3af98e5fc5/1b503392972693f21c9e379b402e2523b240647e8007973f4a59df22d8ddff93.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"93ec24eb-1be7-4c9e-9f05-9a3af98e5fc5","revision":"sha256:1b503392972693f21c9e379b402e2523b240647e8007973f4a59df22d8ddff93","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"BinQueue_Insert\nThe function BinQueue_Insert is to insert X into a binomial queue H, and return H as the result."},{"type":"code","content":"BinQueue BinQueue_Insert( ElementType X, BinQueue H )\n{\n    BinTree Carry; \n    int i; \n\n    H->CurrentSize++;\n    Carry = malloc( sizeof( struct BinNode ) );\n    Carry->Element = X;\n    Carry->LeftChild = Carry->NextSibling = NULL;\n\n    i = 0;\n    while ( H->TheTrees[i] ) { \n        Carry = CombineTrees( Carry, ____(1)____); //combine two equal-sized trees\n        H->TheTrees[i++] = NULL;\n    }\n    ____(2)____;\n    return  H;\n}","language":"c"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"(1) `H->TheTrees[i]`\n(2) `H->TheTrees[i] = Carry`"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"依次合并同阶二项树并进位, 最后将 Carry 放入第一个空槽位。函数假定内存分配成功且树表容量足够"}],"response":{"fields":[{"id":"blank1","label":"第 1 空","kind":"text","blank":"____(1)____"},{"id":"blank2","label":"第 2 空","kind":"text","blank":"____(2)____"}]}}}}]}